    summary: "Saudi authorities say danger passes in Dammam, al-Ahsa and Abqaiq The General Directorate of Saudi Civil Defense said the danger in the city of Dammam and the provinces of al-Ahsa and Abqaiq has now passed. Minutes earlier, the directorate issued alerts warning of “potential danger” in Dammam, Abqaiq, and Dhahran, and the eastern province of al-Ahsa. It warned that filming, publishing or sharing information related to any missile or drone attacks could trigger legal action.",
